## Why This Is Asked
Tests a practical DP over partitions with a non-trivial subproblem (distinct counts) and reconstruction.

## Key Concepts
- DP over contiguous partitions
- Precomputation of distinct counts for all subarrays
- Backpointers for block reconstruction

## Code Example
